  "description": "Meet Ji Yoonyoung, a BL novelist who has everything—except the ability to write spicy scenes! With deadlines constantly looming and his editor, Lee Sero, sending back relentless critiques, Yoonyoung is in a creative crisis. After another long night of frustration, Yoonyoung decides to drink his sorrows away and ends up spilling his biggest secret to Sero: he's never actually experienced what he's trying to write! \n\nSero’s unexpected response? \"If experience is the problem, let’s fix that.\"\" \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
